(:taskCollection
  :id "Phase442AgentReliabilityUtilities"
  :createdAt 1789139714894
  :status "planned"
  :priorityOrder 6
  :summary "Agent Reliability and Multidimensional Observability Utilities: instruments that close the blind spots measured in session 43abe3b2 on 2026-09-11 — an agent cannot verify its own tools, cannot run a command and read its real status, cannot detect a concurrent writer, cannot check a plan mechanically, cannot find prior decisions, and cannot see a broken baseline."
  :phase "Phase442AgentReliabilityUtilities"
  :baseline "2026-09-11 session 43abe3b2: host diff reported differing files as identical; exit codes read through a pipe inverted two findings; a settlement run overwrote another session amendments and a checkout reverted a 1220-line removal; a stray delimiter blocked Gate 2 for forty minutes unnoticed; the structural plan checks were run fifteen times by hand; two decision ledgers diverged by 227 lines because prior decisions were unsearchable."
  :tasks [
    (:task
      :id "Task44201"
      :parentId ""
      :phase "phase-442"
      :title "Capability and environment truth probe: asl doctor"
      :kind :protocol
      :lane "reliability"
      :state :done
      :priority :critical
      :ownerRole "implementer"
      :createdAt 1789139714894
      :updatedAt 1789139714894
      :motivation "Measured 2026-09-11 in session 43abe3b2: the host diff reported two files with different sha256 as identical, grep is a ugrep shim and rg a grep-compatible shim, head and wc were rewritten to rtk; separately :status ok was returned for ops that do nothing and asl test passed a file whose only assertion was (assert (= 1 2)). An agent cannot detect any of this from inside a task and will build on false readings. No utility verifies the agent own instruments."
      :purpose "asl doctor probes the environment and the engine against known-answer fixtures and reports an ASN capability map: for each shell utility whether it is the expected binary and returns the expected answer on a fixture; for each RPC op whether it returns a payload, a rejection or a silent ok; whether a planted assertion failure, a planted comment and a planted foreign file are actually caught. Exit 1 when any capability claimed by the rules block or a skill is not real."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["asl doctor emits (:capabilities …) with one row per utility and per RPC op" "Known-answer fixtures under tests/doctor" "Exit 1 on any false capability" "Skills and the rules block are checked against the measured map"]
      :owns ["asl/tools/asl.c" "tests/doctor" ".agents/skills/asl-toolbelt/SKILL.md"]
      :targetSymbols ["run_doctor" "execute_single_step"]
      :relatedSymbols ["tools" "concepts" "gates"]
      :invariants ["D34" "D81"]
      :variations (:contractRef D81SettledChoices)
      :failureModes (:contractRef D81TaskFailureModes)
      :additionalRequirements (:contractRef D81Ownership)
