      :title "Executable plan verifier: asl plan verify"
      :kind :gate
      :lane "reliability"
      :state :done
      :priority :high
      :ownerRole "implementer"
      :createdAt 1789139714894
      :updatedAt 1789139714894
      :motivation "Measured 2026-09-11: the structural plan checks (unique ids, resolvable dependsOn, acyclicity, contractRef resolution, declared ownership, and every gate failing on baseline) were run fifteen times by hand from throwaway scripts in this session alone, twice catching real defects the ledger tools missed: three duplicated task records and three gates that passed on baseline and were therefore vacuous. The consistency audit does not check any of this."
      :purpose "asl plan verify walks the task collections and reports per plan: duplicate identities, dangling or cyclic dependencies, unresolved contract references, undeclared ownership, :owns paths absent in a completed phase as distinct from planned outputs, and every gate executed on the current tree with a required non-zero result for tasks not yet done. Exit 1 on any finding; output is ASN."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["asl plan verify with ASN findings" "Gate falsifiability executed, not assumed" "Missing :owns split by phase completion" "Wired into gate 7"]
      :owns ["asl/tools/asl.c" "asl/packages/asl-gates/src"]
