      :verificationRole "independentVerifier"
      :verificationOwns ["tests/acceptance/d81/Task44204.asl"]
      :verificationCases ["A duplicated task identity, a dependency cycle, an unresolved contractRef and a gate that passes on baseline are each reported and fail the command; a clean plan exits 0." "A planned task owning a future output does not fail; a completed phase owning an absent path does."]
