      :phase "phase-442"
      :title "Continuous pre-flight: asl watch"
      :kind :tooling
      :lane "reliability"
      :state :planned
      :priority :medium
      :ownerRole "implementer"
      :createdAt 1789139714894
      :updatedAt 1789139714894
      :motivation "Measured 2026-09-11: an unbalanced delimiter introduced by one session left Gate 2 hard-failing with SIGABRT for forty minutes before any agent noticed, and it was found only because a human pasted an audit. Balance and lint are cheap and nothing runs them between tasks."
      :purpose "asl watch runs delimiter balance, lint and the fastest gate subset over changed files on an interval or on demand, writes the result to the session ledger, and makes (:where) surface a red tree so the next agent re-anchors onto a broken baseline instead of building on it."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["asl watch over changed files" "Result recorded in the session ledger" "(:where) reports a red tree"]
