      :verificationRole "independentVerifier"
      :verificationOwns ["tests/acceptance/d81/Task44206.asl"]
      :verificationCases ["With a planted imbalance the watcher records a red tree and (:where) reports it before the next mutation is authorized; a clean tree records green and does not block." "The watcher never rewrites source and holds no lease."]
