      :ownerRole "implementer"
      :createdAt 1789141198808
      :updatedAt 1789141198808
      :motivation "An agent that does not know which of its tools work will use a broken one and build on its answer; measured 2026-09-11, 22 of 36 declared capabilities are absent or actively misleading while the skill tables presented them as available. Hand-written status is the same drift that put 62 references to eight nonexistent subcommands into the skills, so status must be produced by measurement, not by an author."
      :purpose "asl/grammar/capabilities.asn declares each capability keyed by situation with :use, :fallback, :task and :tier but never a hand-written truth claim; asl doctor measures every one against a known-answer fixture and writes asl/grammar/capabilities.lock; the renderer joins declaration and measurement into the skill tool tables and the client payloads; (:where) returns only the capability slice for the current step kind and tier; gate 7 fails when a declared status contradicts the lock or when the lock is older than the engine binary."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["capabilities.asn declares situation, use, fallback, task and tier only" "asl doctor writes capabilities.lock with a measured status per capability" "Skill tool tables and client payloads are rendered from the join, never hand-edited" "(:where) returns the capability slice for the step kind and tier" "Gate 7 fails on declared-versus-measured divergence or a stale lock"]
      :owns ["asl/grammar/capabilities.asn" "asl/grammar/capabilities.lock" "asl/tools/asl.c" "scripts/install.sh" ".agents/skills/asl-toolbelt/SKILL.md"]
